any parent.","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"feb0ba00e3382e0c55e4b3615648217d7d619198","date":"2026-10-01T22:20:05+03:00","message":"(chore) Remove unused stylesheet classes from the reports app","refs":"","body":"Delete 13 CSS Module classes in esm-reports-app that no component\nreferences. Each stylesheet is a CSS Module, so a class only applies\nwhen a file that imports that stylesheet uses it as styles.<name>, and\nnone of these are:\n\n- root.scss: welcome, explainer (plus the @carbon/type import, which\n  only welcome used)\n- components/reports.scss: emptyButton, breadcrumbsSlot\n- components/overlay.scss: closeButton, overlayContent (the desktop and\n  tablet breakpoint blocks contained only overlayContent)\n- components/run-report/run-report-form.scss: parameterElement,\n  cancelActionButton, tableIcon, rowCellEven, rowCellOdd\n- components/edit-scheduled-report/edit-scheduled-report-form.scss:\n  reportButton\n- components/simple-cron-editor/simple-cron-editor.scss: cronEditor\n\nrowCellEven, rowCellOdd and reportButton are still in use, but from\nother stylesheets: the overview tables use the copies in reports.scss,\nand the run report form uses the copy in run-report-form.scss. Only the\nunreferenced duplicates are removed.\n","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"fbda030326a3a0a691844ad052fe7aed34ca44ac","date":"2026-10-01T21:08:13+03:00","message":"chore: Remove inert Carbon CSS rules from reports app (#358)","refs":"","body":"Co-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>","authorName":"solomonfortune","authorEmail":"solomonbuwule@gmail.com"},{"hash":"3b89049a21f459607357c7704b11137465d948a1","date":"2026-09-27T00:43:49+05:30","message":"(chore) O3-5860: Add @carbon/react to peerDependencies (#324)","refs":"","body":"Declare @carbon/react as a 1.x peer in the OCL, patient documents admin, reports, system admin and metadata export apps, so the build tooling shares it w